/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (RoboGrinder welcomes students of all majors and experience levels. Many members join without prior robotics experience and learn by doing, working alongside more experienced students from their first season on. That said, the team is competitive, and spots are limited, so prior experience and personal projects strengthen an application considerably. Students newer to robotics often start on the Operations team, contributing right away while getting an inside look at how the team works, then move to a technical sub-team when they reapply the following season.)
