/Title (The ARC Robotics Competition \(formerly RoboMaster North America\) plays like a real-world crossover between a First-Person Shooter \(FPS\) and a Multiplayer Online Battle Arena \(MOBA\). Two teams face off in high-speed tactical matches, deploying fleets of custom-built, semi-autonomous, and fully autonomous robots. Operators control these machines with no direct line of sight to the robots, steering and aiming entirely through real-time FPV camera feeds.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 545 0 R
/Next 568 0 R
>>
endobj
568 0 obj
<<
/Title (To win, teams must coordinate different robot classes to capture strategic map objectives and defeat the opposing base. Hits are tracked instantly by pressure-sensitive armor plates connected to a digital referee system, which monitors hit points \(HP\) and electrical power limits in real time.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 545 0 R
/Prev 567 0 R
>>
endobj
